62812","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775040/ss_f584ecadc92bb4c802abaefd7c999289b20b9de4.600x338.jpg?t=1744962812"}],"short_description":"SokoFarm is a Sokoban puzzle game with bright, cosy visuals and cute characters played out in a sleepy rural setting. Roll Chonky Chickens, Ducks and Geese to their preferred nests in the fewest moves possible. Play through the seasons to see new farms and features for even more brain teasing fun!","steam_appid":2775040,"support_info":{"email":"Contact@daredevil-development.com","url":"https://www.daredevil-development.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Russian, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":"https://www.daredevil-development.com"}